DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Community\, Discussion\, Health & Wellness\, A
 dults\, Seniors\n\nEver wonder why some plants seem to take over your yard
  overnight while your prize roses struggle to keep up? Lancaster County Pa
 rks is pulling back the curtain on the ecological outlaws hiding in plain 
 sight.Whether you're a frustrated homeowner trying to reclaim your flowerb
 eds or a curious naturalist interested in the strange world of invasive ga
 rdening\, we have the intel you need at this class!
LOCATION:Manheim Community\, MAN Community Room
