X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup The Creative House Of Lancaster": "https://www.meetup.com/the-creative-house-of-lancaster/events/314281163/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_the_creative_house_of_lancaster
X-SOURCE:Meetup: The Creative House of Lancaster
UID:event_314281163@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260420T032738Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260423T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260423T210000
SUMMARY:The Indie Journalist Meetup
DESCRIPTION:The Creative House of Lancaster\n*Join us for the Indie Journa
 list Meetup at [The Candy Factory](www.coworkinginlancaster.com) (TCF)\, 3
 42 N. Queen St.\, Lancaster.*\n\nCreator journalism is on the rise. I had 
 the privilege of attending the ONA (online news association) conference in
  Chicago (thanks\, Jess!) a few weeks ago (with fellow Lancastrian Ed Hank
 o) and there was a ton of info and conversation around the benefits and ch
 allenges of being an independent creator journalist. For this meetup\, I w
 ill report back my overall findings and impressions\, which will be a jump
 ing off point for... how do we create independent news formats (newsletter
 s\, blogs\, podcasts\, etc.) that are not just fulfilling but financially 
 viable. I don't think there's a playbook\, but curious to start throwing a
 round ideas. There will be plenty of room for open discussion and question
 s as well.\n\n**ABOUT THE INDIE JOURNALIST MEETUP**\nA meetup for independ
 ent creator journalists covering news\, events\, culture\, and lifestyle w
 hile navigating the creator economy in Lancaster and surrounding areas. Al
 l creators welcome: podcasters\, freelance writers\, bloggers\, YouTubers\
 , livestreamers\, and more!\n\nOur mission is to create a space to gather 
 in real life\, to discuss the rewards and challenges of bringing authentic
  news and information to the Lancaster community\, and to encourage partic
 ipants to collaborate and share knowledge when appropriate to strengthen o
 ur local information ecosystem.\n\n**ABOUT YOUR HOST**\nJason Mundok is a 
 seasoned media producer with over two decades of experience creating compe
 lling content and leading creative teams. At So Good Media\, he produces a
 udio podcasts\, marketing videos\, and original programming.\n\nHe current
 ly hosts *[So Good Lancaster](https://sogoodlancaster.com/)*\, a show that
  celebrates the people and ideas that make Lancaster\, PA\, so good.\n\nTh
 e Creative House of Lancaster is a project of [The Candy Factory\, a cowor
 king + social club](http://www.coworkinginlancaster.com/) located in the h
 eart of Lancaster\, PA.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/the-creative-house-of-lancaster/event
 s/314281163/
