X-SOURCE-ID:grandviewwines
X-SOURCE:Grandview Vineyard
DTSTART;TZID=UTC:20260424T170000
DTEND;TZID=UTC:20260424T210000
DTSTAMP:20260420T032137
CREATED:20250401T184816Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260324T010244Z
UID:5513-1777050000-1777064400@grandviewwines.com
SUMMARY:Spring Deck Opening Celebration at grandview
DESCRIPTION:Let’s kick off our Wine by the Vine ON DECK season with a little fun! Join us for our deck opening Friday April 24th with music by The Nobles 6-8:30 pm AND Saturday April 25th with music by Corina Rose 2-5pm and Blake Hillard Duo 6-8:30pm. \nWe’ll have specialty cocktails\, drink specials and deck passes ON SALE Buy one get one 1/2 off Friday 5-9pm and Saturday 12-9pm! (on-site only) Free Admission. 1st come 1st serve seating.\nGourmet Julia’s Way Food truck on site Saturday 1:30-7pm
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/spring-deck-opening-weekend-celebration-at-grandview/2026-04-24/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Wine-By-the-Vine-Deck-Series-5.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Zestchef": "https://zestchef.com/class/2758-spring-cheesecakes/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:zestchef
X-SOURCE:Zest Chef
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260424T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260424T190000
DTSTAMP:20260419T232755
CREATED:20260217T235148Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260217T235148Z
UID:10000371-1777050000-1777057200@zestchef.com
SUMMARY:2758 - Spring Cheesecakes
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the flavors of spring in this hands-on baking class with Pastry Chef Faith Kennedy. Guests will learn the fundamentals of creating smooth\, balanced cheesecakes while exploring lighter\, seasonal flavor combinations. This class focuses on techniques\, from mixing and baking to finishing and presentation\, giving you the confidence to recreate beautiful cheesecakes at home for any spring gathering. \nHands on. BYOB. Ages 16 and up. Vegetarian. Gluten Free \n\nLemon Ricotta Cheesecake\nMini Brown Butter and Vanilla Bean cheesecake\nPistachio Basque Cheesecake
URL:https://zestchef.com/class/2758-spring-cheesecakes/
LOCATION:Zest Cooking School\, 1180 Erbs Quarry Road\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
CATEGORIES:Basics and Techniques,Dessert,Gluten Free,Let's Bake,Vegetarian
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://zestchef.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/cheesecakes-spring-2026-e1771372249664.jpg
END:VEVENT
