SUMMARY:2760 - Date Night: Caribbean Classics
DESCRIPTION:Explore the bold\, comforting flavors of the Caribbean in this hands-on cooking class with Chef Flora Gonzalez. This class dives into working with plantains\, building layered flavors\, and understanding the foundations of Caribbean cooking.  \nHands on. BYOB. Ages 18 and up. Tickets are priced per person. Gluten free \n\nGarlic Mofongo (Green Plantains with Fresh Garlic & Seasonings)\nBistec Encebollado (Marinated Steak with Caramelized Onions)\nFresh Avocado Salad with Citrus Dressing
