DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Storytime\, Children\n\nEveryone can be an art
 ist! Kids are invited to come explore great works of art and the artists b
 ehind them! Each class will focus on learning about well-known artists. We
  will then create our own artwork using their art and style as our inspira
 tion. Join in as we learn about design\, method\, thinking and problem-sol
