SUMMARY:Oh Captain My Captain! for Tweens
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260512T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260512T173000
UID:cc0b3d26970dd14dc021a446cda3a60b@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Tweens\n\nOh Captain\, My Captain! is a short form wo
 rldbuilding role-playing game (RPG) that explores heroism and the complica
 ted relationships we have with people we admire. The game revolves around 
 players drawing from a deck of cards with open-ended questions. Each quest
 ion players answer helps them learn about their character\, their world\, 
 their captain and the complicated relationship they have with a living leg
 end. Players use these answers to make connections between their stories l
 eading up one of three final questions that end the game. No experience or
  prep needed! Ages 10-12.
LOCATION:Ephrata\, EPH 1/2 Multipurpose Room Kitchen Side
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/oh-captain-my-captain-tw
 eens-154250
