 \, Seniors\, Everyone\n\nOpen to all ages. This exhibit will run through J
 une 1.We welcome this exhibit from the Octoraro Art Association. The OAA w
 as founded in 1948 by local\, world-renowned artist Charles X. Carlson and
  Oxford businessman John W. Roberts. Their objective was to enhance the cu
 lture of the Oxford area through exhibits\, art workshops\, and classes.Th
 e Octoraro Art Association continues its mission to this day. They are a g
 roup of painters and potters who gather together sharing ideas and inspira
 tion. They meet Thursdays from 1-3 pm at 5965 Forge Road in Oxford PA.
