SUMMARY:Legacy of Liberty: Researching your Revolutionary War Roots
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260521T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260521T163000
UID:da4efd33633e531b2dea5b1e986a3e52@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Discussion\, Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nJo
 in us for an introductory genealogy workshop focused on uncovering the pat
 riots in your family tree. Whether you are looking to join a lineage socie
 ty or are simply curious about your ancestors’ roles in the American Rev
