SUMMARY:Virtual Webinar: Tiny Worlds of the Appalachian Mountains by Rosalie Haizlett
DESCRIPTION:Author Rosalie Haizlett is coming virtually to Lancaster County during Water Week to discuss her book Tiny Worlds of the Appalachian Mountains\, an Artist’s Journey .  Register here for this free\, all ages Water Week event. \n 
