BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/parachute-play-154570"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Parachute Play
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260615T101500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260615T104500
UID:2a8cfdcfbfae117c4aea2867346d8790@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nJoin us for a cooperative m
 ovement program where we will use our imaginations while we play with a pa
 rachute! Stories and songs will be incorporated\, while we move about and 
 use our motor skills. A great activity for young children and their adults
  to come together and share an exciting and engaging play experience! (Mus
 t be 18 months-younger 3 years old with an adult\, adult involvement is re
 quired)Adults attending with their child(ren) do NOT need to register. Ple
 ase add any additional registrants to your registration if more than one c
 hild that will be participating in the program.Registration will open at 9
 :00AM on Wednesday\, June 3rd for Manheim Township and East Lampeter resid
 ents and on Friday\, June 5th for residents of other municipalities.Storyt
 ime PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for m
 ore than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from registering
  for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel you
 r registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allo
 w for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registra
 tion status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start 
 of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program w
 ill begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will b
 e forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots 
 remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrant
 s will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time
 .Accompanying Adults – This program is for adults and children to enjoy 
 together. Please plan to attend and be engaged with your child. Drop offs 
 will not be permitted.Cancellations- Please check your email prior to depa
 rting to verify that the program has not been cancelled.Program Limits - P
 atrons are limited to one session of multiple session programs per week.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/parachute-play-154570
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
