BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/preschool-party-154726"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Preschool Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260617T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260617T114500
UID:444f8ef6c3f1780e14524da3acb63e46@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Children\n\nJoin Ms. Laura for a fun and engaging 
 preschool program designed to spark curiosity and a love for learning in y
 oung children! This program features stories\, songs\, and hands-on activi
 ties tailored for preschool-aged kids. Each session focuses on building ea
 rly literacy\, motor skills\, and social interaction through playful explo
 ration.Perfect for ages 3–6 with an adult\, this program provides a welc
 oming and inclusive environment where kids can learn and grow together. Pa
 rents and caregivers are encouraged to participate and share in the joy of
  discovery with their little ones.Ms. Laura has over 20 years of preschool
  classroom experience bringing a wealth of knowledge in early childhood de
 velopment. Her approach focuses on creating a warm\, engaging\, and suppor
 tive environment where children can thrive.Adults attending with their chi
 ld(ren) do NOT need to register. Please add any additional registrants to 
 your registration if more than one child that will be participating in the
  program.Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, June 3rd for Manh
 eim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, June 8th for resi
 dents of other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failin
 g to cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in a month
  will be restricted from registering for future programs for a period of o
 ne month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior
  to the start of the program to allow for those on the waiting list to be 
 notified of their change in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please a
 rrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking an
 d other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated t
 ime. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list 
 who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed in
 to the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the p
 rogram 5 minutes past the start time.Accompanying Adults – This program 
 is for adults and children to enjoy together. Please plan to attend and be
  engaged with your child. Drop offs will not be permitted.Cancellations- P
 lease check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has n
 ot been cancelled.Program Limits - Patrons are limited to one session of m
 ultiple session programs per week.Preschool Party Registration Requirement
 s – All children who will be participating in the craft will need to be 
 registered as a participant to allow for adequate supplies.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/preschool-party-154726
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
