X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/babys-first-storytime-159976"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Baby's First Storytime!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260620T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260620T104500
UID:31aa69ccfbabc10c0dd17a8d645ce61e@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Babies\n\nJoin us for a special time just for babi
 es as we sing and share stories\, rhymes and finger plays with our grown-u
 ps! This program is adapted from M. Stanley\, MLS\, and Betsy Diamant-Cohe
 n’s award-winning Mother Goose on the Loose curriculum. Best for ages bi
 rth-17 months. Considerate siblings and other adults are welcome!
