BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Amtshows": "https://amtshows.com/show/patty-griffin-kathleen-edwards/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:amtshows
X-SOURCE:American Music Theatre
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260718T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260718T200000
DTSTAMP:20260419T232125
CREATED:20260414T133029Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260409T183616Z
UID:10001877-1784404800-1784404800@amtshows.com
SUMMARY:Patty Griffin & Kathleen Edwards
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $39 $49 $59 $69\nAMT Member Pre-Sale: Wednesday\, April 15 at 10:00 a.m.\nPublic On-Sale: Friday\, April 17 at 10:00 a.m. \nPatty Griffin\, a two-time GRAMMY® Award winner and one of the most influential singer-songwriters of her generation\, brings her deeply personal and emotionally rich music to the stage. Celebrated for her masterful storytelling and soulful voice\, Griffin has spent over two decades crafting songs that explore love\, loss\, identity\, and the shared experiences that connect us all. \nBlending folk\, Americana\, and blues\, her music resonates with honesty and depth. Her latest album\, Crown of Roses\, is an intimate and introspective collection born from a period of reflection\, offering songs that speak to resilience\, transformation\, and embracing new truths. Experience an evening with an artist whose songs linger long after the final note. \nKathleen Edwards is a modern-day cornerstone of North American roots music. Since making her debut with 2002’s Failer\, she’s spent the 21st century occupying the grey area between genres\, swirling together her own mix of alt-country\, folk\, and heartland rock & roll. It’s a sound that has earned its creator more than a half-dozen Juno nominations\, shows with icons like Bob Dylan and Willie Nelson\, and Top 40 success on both sides of the Canadian/American border. From co-writes with Maren Morris to critically-acclaimed solo records like Back to Me\, Asking for Flowers\, Voyageur\, and Total Freedom\, Edwards has become a leader of the Americana community\, even as her ever-evolving music reaches beyond the format’s boundaries. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/patty-griffin-kathleen-edwards/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://amtshows.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/PGKE_Concessions-Events-and-News-for-Website-1920x1080-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
